1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In all realms, we hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Dare to cleave the primal chaos♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:42,340
[Episode 15]

10
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,490
Top priority right now

11
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:45,690
is stopping her
from taking the Pregenesis Sword.

12
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:46,850
You brat.

13
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,130
Why does she want the sword?

14
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:51,260
She wants
to take the Sea-Calming Pillar.

15
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,900
Do you know

16
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,260
what happens

17
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:57,380
if the Sea-Calming Pillar is taken?

18
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,900
I must have it.

19
00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:00,850
Why?

20
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:06,050
Because someone mightier told me,

21
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:07,180
soon,

22
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,260
a world-ending Great Tribulation

23
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,060
will descend upon the Three Realms.

24
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,730
Fate?

25
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,820
You've seen Fate too?

26
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,220
How come I never saw it?

27
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:40,850
Fate once told me

28
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:44,780
the Three Realms would
face a Great Tribulation.

29
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,260
All life will suffer,
barely one in ten surviving.

30
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:50,890
I thought I was the only one.

31
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:52,780
I'd rather never have met it

32
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,380
or heard its warning.

33
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,380
I wasn't even told about this.

34
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,850
How could it tell you first?

35
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:03,170
You only need to return

36
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:04,450
to the Celestial Court to escape it.

37
00:03:04,470 --> 00:03:05,340
What are you afraid of?

38
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,260
That makes sense.

39
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,260
The Celestial Court is short-handed.

40
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,660
Even so,

41
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,100
that only saves me alone,

42
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,500
not the entire Seizing Sect.

43
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:15,290
When someone

44
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:17,610
acts with no choice,

45
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:20,850
she must have loved ones.

46
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:22,100
You know Trifairy Isle?

47
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,780
You think I'm doing this for myself?

48
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,980
If it were just for myself,

49
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,100
I could simply live freely.

50
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,450
You're not acting for yourself,

51
00:03:31,910 --> 00:03:33,660
but to save the sect members?

52
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,890
What else did Fate tell you?

53
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,220
Fate also told me

54
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,450
when the Great Tribulation arrives,

55
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,570
the entire Seizing Sect

56
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,290
will die horribly,

57
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,690
wiped out completely.

58
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,940
Fate also said,

59
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,340
only by gathering
all twelve Spirit Treasures,

60
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:51,100
can the entire Seizing Sect be saved.

61
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,100
That's why you changed

62
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,500
and seized treasures everywhere.

63
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,220
If Fate seeks to kill me,

64
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,410
I bear no complaint.

65
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,340
But if Fate means

66
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,060
to hurt my fellow disciples,

67
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:03,850
even if it is my Fated Mandate,

68
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,060
I will fight till the end.

69
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,500
Have you ever thought,

70
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:10,690
if you take the Sea-Calming Pillar,

71
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:13,450
the Great Tribulation will truly begin?

72
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:18,580
Though I don't know

73
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,900
what this Great Tribulation is,

74
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,700
a catastrophe leaving barely

75
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:25,980
one in ten

76
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,780
happened 1,000 years ago.

77
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,020
The Deity-Demon War?

78
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:35,810
Beneath the East Sea Eye,

79
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,290
sealed by the Sea-Calming Pillar,

80
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:40,050
lies the Demon Emperor, defeated then.

81
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,250
So now you know

82
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,850
why I can't let you take it.

83
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,290
But what if

84
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,810
the Great Tribulation

85
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:51,250
has nothing to do with the East Sea Eye,

86
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,490
then what could I use

87
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:53,660
to save my fellow disciples?

88
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,780
If you forcibly take it,

89
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,370
that moment

90
00:04:57,870 --> 00:04:59,250
guarantees a total catastrophe.

91
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,700
Well...

92
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,100
I have an idea.

93
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,660
What are you doing?

94
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,700
Destroying it if you can't have it?

95
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,020
Yunxiao, don't be fooled.

96
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,100
What?

97
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,660
Just think it over.

98
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,490
Why did the Westdawn Sect
set up the Sea Demon scheme

99
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,100
to find the Pregenesis Sword?

100
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,460
For the Sea-Calming Pillar?

101
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,700
What's the motive of the person

102
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,850
who lured you into this?

103
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,660
To trigger

104
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:47,660
the Great Tribulation?

105
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:50,100
Who lured you into this,

106
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:51,410
and what do they want?

107
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,020
To make me trigger it myself.

108
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,810
This Great Tribulation from Fate

109
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:05,810
won't appear out of nowhere.

110
00:06:05,830 --> 00:06:07,170
So I guess

111
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:10,290
a force behind the scenes

112
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:12,170
is pushing the Great Tribulation.

113
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:13,810
That force

114
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,700
is likely the Westdawn Sect.

115
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,980
And the Celestial Court does nothing?

116
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,490
Westdawn is a small sect in Cattle Land.

117
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,850
Unrevealed for a millennium.

118
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,850
Even if the Celestial Court
wants to act,

119
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,020
they cannot locate it.

120
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,170
Besides, the Celestial Court is new.

121
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,370
Barely managing itself.

122
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,220
Westdawn lay low for years

123
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,490
just to set this trap.

124
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:32,700
If my guess is right,

125
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:34,780
their power isn't just on Bear Island,

126
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,850
but also Ascendance Sect,

127
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:37,170
and even Dragon Palace.

128
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,250
When did you notice?

129
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,580
Since I found

130
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,900
someone eyeing the Pregenesis Sword,

131
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,250
I had my suspicions.

132
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,580
If so,

133
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,020
what's your plan?

134
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,460
Since the villagers believe in deities,

135
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:54,170
why can't you and I

136
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,610
become their deities?

137
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,580
So at that moment,

138
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,610
you planned to split the sword?

139
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,250
Making up scenarios, huh?

140
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,610
What plan?

141
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,610
I split the sword into three pieces.

142
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,660
One piece for each of us three.

143
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:15,290
If Westdawn wants the sword,

144
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,580
they must gather all three of us.

145
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:18,460
If any one of us three

146
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,700
meets with trouble,

147
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,490
the other two will know.

148
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:23,100
That leaves them no way to strike.

149
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,020
Brilliant!

150
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,700
This way,

151
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:28,780
Fairy Yunxiao can't take the pillar,

152
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,250
and the Celestial Court can rest easy.

153
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,370
What if...

154
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:36,220
What if the Great Tribulation arrives,

155
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,900
and the Seizing Sect faces annihilation?

156
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:40,220
I, Li Changshou,

157
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:42,170
am willing to offer my piece.

158
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,290
And I'll humbly ask Your Majesty

159
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,170
to show mercy

160
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:48,410
to the Seizing Sect

161
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:51,100
and help you unlock
the Sea-Calming Pillar.

162
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,490
If the Great Tribulation truly begins,

163
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,660
whether the Eye of the Sea can be sealed

164
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,290
hardly matters anymore.

165
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,290
I'll lend you my full support, Fairy.

166
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:04,580
What do you say, Yunxiao?

167
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,580
So,

168
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,100
everything you did on Bear Island

169
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,850
was all for me?

170
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:19,490
People who don't know you

171
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,100
might get the wrong idea

172
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,580
from what they've heard.

173
00:08:23,430 --> 00:08:25,290
But after being with you these days,

174
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,490
I trust you.

175
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:37,490
No one has ever

176
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,700
dared defy me as you have.

177
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,890
And no one has ever

178
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,770
trusted me the way you do.

179
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:44,700
You...

180
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,610
Don't you resent me for using you?

181
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,100
Aren't you afraid I'll trick you?

182
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:49,420
If that day comes,

183
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,700
this brat

184
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:52,700
will have a plan.

185
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,220
You brat.

186
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,010
Always full of tricky ideas.

187
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,220
Thank you.

188
00:09:24,260 --> 00:09:26,140
[Li Changshou]

189
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:29,540
[Yunxiao]

190
00:09:29,910 --> 00:09:30,530
That's odd.

191
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,340
Where is Ke Le'er?

192
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,010
Everyone,

193
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,100
I must take my leave.

194
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:43,180
Grandlord.

195
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:46,010
If you leave, what about us mortals?

196
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:46,700
Yeah.

197
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,370
Right.

198
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:48,940
What about us?

199
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,100
Don't worry, everyone.

200
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,250
Though I leave,

201
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:55,850
the Sea Deity Sect

202
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,890
will carry on.

203
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,180
Really?

204
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,580
I hereby declare

205
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,650
the Grandlord of the Sea Deity Sect

206
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,700
goes to Changgeng the Great.

207
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,010
Wonderful!

208
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:08,650
Changgeng the Great.

209
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:10,220
We have a new Grandlord.

210
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:11,490
A new Grandlord.

211
00:10:11,510 --> 00:10:12,490
- Great.
- Sea Deity Sect.

212
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,300
A new Grandlord.

213
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,490
Let's greet the new Grandlord.

214
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,460
Hail the new Grandlord.

215
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:17,460
Hail the new Grandlord.

216
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,610
Dumping the karma you don't want

217
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:21,220
right onto me, huh?

218
00:10:21,510 --> 00:10:23,490
- This was your doing.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

219
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:25,990
- Handle it yourself.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

220
00:10:27,070 --> 00:10:28,100
Hail the new Grandlord.

221
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,490
- Hail the new Grandlord.
- I mean...

222
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:32,300
- These people are already so strong.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

223
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,700
Way stronger than ordinary people.

224
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,890
So why still worship any deity?

225
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,490
You haven't seen

226
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,420
how miserably the Ancestral Witch heirs

227
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:43,370
used to live.

228
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,180
Miserably?

229
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:48,850
Back then, Ancestral Witch heirs
forged the Pregenesis Sword.

230
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,220
Fearing someone would steal it,

231
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,650
they put a restriction on it.

232
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:57,180
It must be consecrated
with an Ancestral Witch heir's blood

233
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,980
to unleash its power.

234
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,980
Without the blood,

235
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:04,060
the sword

236
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:06,890
is just an ordinary blade.

237
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:09,220
Consecrated with blood?

238
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,370
You've figured it out, right?

239
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,490
Back then, the Demon Emperor

240
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:15,700
kept the Ancestral Witch heirs captive,

241
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,460
killing one to consecrate the sword

242
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:19,650
before every campaign.

243
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,490
The Ancestral Witch heirs

244
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,700
were tormented for years.

245
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,700
And these surviving villagers

246
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,890
forgot long ago

247
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,580
their identity as Ancestral Witch heirs,

248
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:35,060
yet always remembered

249
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:38,460
the fear and awe of waiting for deities

250
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:41,220
to save them.

251
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:49,770
Enough moping. Let's go.

252
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:50,820
There are still plenty of matters

253
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,980
for you to judge up above.

254
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,770
Let's get moving.

255
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:56,250
Why is there always so much to do?

256
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,420
Fine, fine.

257
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:00,730
Hurry.

258
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,420
Bye.

259
00:12:09,630 --> 00:12:11,180
I finally got...

260
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:12,940
Earth Evasion.

261
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,300
Where is the Grandlord?

262
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,490
Grandlord?

263
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:18,100
Where is the Grandlord?

264
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:18,980
Grandlord?

265
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:21,650
Our Grandlord has gone.

266
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,850
Stay calm, everyone.

267
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,180
No one panic.

268
00:12:25,150 --> 00:12:25,700
Dad.

269
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,060
- He is not. He is not.
- The Grandlord is gone.

270
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,060
He is not.

271
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,980
He is not the Grandlord.

272
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:32,820
Then who is he?

273
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,490
He is our Deity.

274
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:35,770
Our Deity?

275
00:12:35,790 --> 00:12:36,890
Our Deity?

276
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:38,580
We're leaving Bear Island

277
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:42,850
and bringing him back!

278
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:43,610
Aye.

279
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,850
He is our Deity.

280
00:12:45,870 --> 00:12:46,580
Sea Deity Sect.

281
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:49,820
- He is our Deity!
- Sea Deity Sect.

282
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,850
Sea Deity Sect.

283
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:53,890
As you can see from this chart,

284
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:56,100
[Sea-Calming Pillar]
Westdawn targets the Sea-Calming Pillar,

285
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,770
brewing the Great Tribulation.

286
00:12:57,790 --> 00:13:00,180
The core issue right now
is the Westdawn Sect.

287
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:02,220
This is our biggest threat.

288
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,100
Solve this threat,

289
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,420
and everything gets resolved.

290
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,300
Peaceful Three Realms from then on.

291
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,490
Your Majesty, any questions?

292
00:13:11,510 --> 00:13:12,370
A few points.

293
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:13,490
Go ahead.

294
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:15,010
What is this chart?

295
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,700
It's called a mind map.

296
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,890
Where'd this red thread come from?

297
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,940
I borrowed it from the Moon Elder.

298
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,490
This handwriting is dreadful.

299
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:25,700
Can you please get to the point?

300
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:26,890
The point.

301
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:27,820
I said so much.

302
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:29,250
Can you focus on the point?

303
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,850
You make it all sound neat.

304
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:36,060
But as you can see,

305
00:13:36,390 --> 00:13:37,420
the Celestial Court now

306
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,250
is in dire straits.

307
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:40,700
And the Dragon Clan

308
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,490
has never bowed to rule
for over a thousand years.

309
00:13:42,510 --> 00:13:43,850
We can't get involved.

310
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,250
Plus the Westdawn Sect

311
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,490
never shows its face.

312
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:49,060
We can't even find them.

313
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,890
How can we settle this?

314
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,490
The Sea-Calming Pillar
is in the East Sea,

315
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:55,650
and Westdawn has made its way in.

316
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,770
So the key is

317
00:13:57,790 --> 00:14:00,100
how to use the Celestial Court's power

318
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,100
to enter the East Sea.

319
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:05,180
Any good tricks?

320
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,610
Here.

321
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:12,370
Dragon Clan ascension.

322
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,100
Dragon Clan ascension.

323
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:14,980
That's it?

324
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,890
What does it mean?

325
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,370
Quite simple, actually.

326
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:23,530
Excuse me.

327
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:28,580
I'm in a meeting. What's up?

328
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:30,580
Who's that for you?

329
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:32,610
Go on. Go.

330
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:34,820
I wasn't talking to you.

331
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,490
In sync. Two minds as one.

332
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:42,420
[Unknown Island, South Sea]

333
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,370
Yunxiao.

334
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:50,250
The In Sync Technique is really handy.

335
00:14:50,630 --> 00:14:52,220
You brat. Where are you now?

336
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,420
Just escaped from Bear Island.

337
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,220
No wonder.

338
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,060
[Cloud Mist Illusion]
You haven't even changed that outfit.

339
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,420
Am I disturbing you right now?

340
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,650
Definitely not.

341
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:01,820
Not at all if it's you.

342
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,010
Well, if that's the case,

343
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,770
I'll come find you at Jade Division.

344
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,420
How does that sound?

345
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:06,700
No. Please don't.

346
00:15:07,390 --> 00:15:08,700
Dragon Clan ascension?

347
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,490
What does that mean?

348
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,300
Simply put,

349
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,490
it means the Dragon Clan
joins the Celestial Court.

350
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:17,820
Welcome the Celestial Court
into the Dragon Palace,

351
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:20,300
and wipe out the Westdawn Sect entirely.

352
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:24,460
Getting the Dragon Clan to submit

353
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,980
is easier said than done.

354
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:27,890
Actually,

355
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:29,610
it's not as hard as you think.

356
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,610
The Celestial Court needn't
rule the Dragon Clan directly.

357
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:35,250
Just prop up a proxy to handle things.

358
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,180
A proxy?

359
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,580
If a person...

360
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,370
If a dragon exists

361
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,250
whom all dragons obey,

362
00:15:42,270 --> 00:15:43,820
while he obeys you,

363
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,490
doesn't the ascension plan

364
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:47,010
just work out?

365
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,060
Exactly.

366
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,820
Plus,

367
00:15:48,910 --> 00:15:50,580
I already found you

368
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:53,010
a very fitting candidate.

369
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:54,300
You even know him.

370
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,010
Who is it?

371
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,180
The Second Prince of East Sea.

372
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,100
Ao Yi.

373
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,490
Ao Yi?

374
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,370
Do I know him?

375
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:16,610
Ke Le'er

376
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:19,340
is Ao Yi?

377
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,060
Yunxiao.

378
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,770
I was teasing you just now.

379
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,250
I always settle debts clearly.

380
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,700
If you trick me,

381
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,100
I won't let you off.

382
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,490
But you helped me
find the Pregenesis Sword,

383
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:32,300
so I must repay you.

384
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:33,770
Repay me?

385
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,850
What?

386
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,250
Am I ungrateful

387
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:38,580
to you?

388
00:16:38,670 --> 00:16:40,100
No, never.

389
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:41,980
I know you.

390
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:44,340
You never want Karma.

391
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,530
You'd rather keep all things

392
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:47,940
far from you.

393
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:49,340
You sure know me.

394
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,180
Back then,

395
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,130
when I sought an Innate Treasure,

396
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:57,100
I learned that the Ancestor of the Styx

397
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,100
had two swords:

398
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,980
Avici and Genesis.

399
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,980
They took lives without catching karma.

400
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,530
Shall I snatch them for you?

401
00:17:03,670 --> 00:17:04,420
No, no.

402
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,050
Please don't.

403
00:17:05,070 --> 00:17:06,290
Do you prefer the red one or white one?

404
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:07,220
It's alright.

405
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,570
Forget it.

406
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,180
It's nothing.

407
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:14,290
Official Li.

408
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:14,980
Yes.

409
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:17,290
If you can make this happen,

410
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:18,980
that would be a great deed.

411
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:21,900
Ascend straight to the Celestial Court
among immortals.

412
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:22,730
Really?

413
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:26,330
However,

414
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:29,050
if you just talk big

415
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,420
and fail to deliver,

416
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:34,290
that's deceiving the Emperor.

417
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,900
You'll face punishment.

418
00:17:37,070 --> 00:17:38,490
Your Majesty, rest assured.

419
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,900
Leave it to me.

420
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:40,530
Good.

421
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:42,900
Fate keeps bringing us together.

422
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:44,490
I've made up my mind.

423
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,700
I'm rewarding you right now.

424
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:48,010
With what?

425
00:17:51,270 --> 00:17:52,250
I recently

426
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:55,050
finished a new painting.

427
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,250
Never mind.

428
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,140
Didn't I see it on Bear Island?

429
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,620
No need to look again.

430
00:18:03,270 --> 00:18:04,460
This one's different.

431
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:07,090
Trust me, it's truly different.

432
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:09,090
You like neither Avici nor Genesis.

433
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:10,380
There's someone

434
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,420
who doesn't care about treasure?

435
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:14,010
Yunxiao, you misunderstood.

436
00:18:14,510 --> 00:18:17,490
Winning your smile

437
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:20,420
beats all treasures in the world.

438
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:24,380
No one has ever said that to me.

439
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,420
Fine.

440
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:27,980
Since you like

441
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,460
no treasures at all,

442
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:31,460
how about I play you a song?

443
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:33,140
Really?

444
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,900
If you keep saying no,

445
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,700
I'm going to get upset.

446
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:42,810
Thank you for your kindness.

447
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:45,810
I humbly accept.

448
00:18:46,110 --> 00:18:47,010
My good official.

449
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,900
I knew you wanted to see it all along.

450
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,250
No, that's not it. I just...

451
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:54,490
This painting is totally different.

452
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,010
If you dare to back out,

453
00:18:56,310 --> 00:18:57,290
may the punishment find you.

454
00:19:06,510 --> 00:19:07,090
Fine.

455
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:09,860
Thank you for the gift, Your Majesty.

456
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:10,660
Don't mention it.

457
00:19:12,270 --> 00:19:13,570
Oh, Li Changshou.

458
00:19:13,590 --> 00:19:15,290
You're so lucky.

459
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:17,220
Great Immortals' artworks

460
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:19,090
carry the wisdom they attained.

461
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:20,420
Comprehend the Resonance,

462
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,420
and your power will spike,

463
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,220
saving you centuries of cultivation.

464
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,700
How I envy you.

465
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:16,290
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

466
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:18,540
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

467
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:21,960
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

468
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:22,730
That's not good.

469
00:20:23,310 --> 00:20:24,290
He can't handle it.

470
00:20:24,310 --> 00:20:26,090
Come on, man.

471
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:29,490
♪Trekking far and wide♪

472
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:32,600
♪Silent in subtleties♪

473
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,570
♪The task descends on me♪

474
00:20:35,570 --> 00:20:41,860
♪Though millions hinder, it resounds♪

475
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:47,350
♪Transcending gods and demons above♪

476
00:20:47,350 --> 00:20:47,980
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

477
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:49,020
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

478
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:49,950
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

479
00:20:49,950 --> 00:20:51,370
♪If smooth, seek peace♪

480
00:20:51,370 --> 00:20:52,710
♪If tough, stay still;
who fates good and evil♪

481
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:53,980
♪After hardship, sweetness comes♪

482
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,500
♪Set the plan before you drink♪

483
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:56,960
♪Mad ones, why cut their foundation♪

484
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,270
♪The evil knows no shame♪

485
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,550
♪Immortal trials burn cowardice away♪

486
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:00,810
♪The howling wind calls to me♪

487
00:21:00,810 --> 00:21:02,140
♪Gouging eyes
to light the night and ferry souls♪

488
00:21:02,140 --> 00:21:03,670
♪My soul is standing like a mountain♪

489
00:21:03,670 --> 00:21:05,350
♪Arrows in flesh as the string♪

490
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:07,000
♪Chaos births a flowing ode♪

491
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,870
♪Standing tall, heart hides its might♪

492
00:21:08,870 --> 00:21:11,240
♪Today my name reaches heaven♪

493
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:12,180
Oh no.

494
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:13,420
Too much Spiritual Energy?

495
00:21:14,540 --> 00:21:16,390
♪Dragon reborn breaks the chains♪

496
00:21:16,390 --> 00:21:17,880
♪Rising to the primal wild♪

497
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:20,950
♪With firm resolve, I roam the sky♪

498
00:21:20,950 --> 00:21:21,850
♪Under crushing weight♪

499
00:21:21,850 --> 00:21:23,030
♪Wings lift toward clear skies♪

500
00:21:23,030 --> 00:21:24,810
My Spiritual Energy is maxed out.

501
00:21:24,810 --> 00:21:26,260
♪Spawning endless heavenly troops♪

502
00:21:26,260 --> 00:21:27,320
♪Charging against the wind♪

503
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,830
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

504
00:21:28,830 --> 00:21:29,620
♪Even if all brave men fall♪

505
00:21:29,620 --> 00:21:30,910
♪Chugging the murky wine♪

506
00:21:31,310 --> 00:21:32,050
This is...

507
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,250
[Yuan Ze]
Something's off.

508
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,830
[Grand Immortal of Seizing Sect]
It was calm just a moment ago.

509
00:21:56,830 --> 00:21:57,640
[Lord of Turtle Island]

510
00:21:57,640 --> 00:22:00,220
Now it's gone dark and the sea's raging?

511
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:03,460
[Hanzhi, Turtle Island disciple]
Mentor, say less.

512
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:04,660
Come help me.

513
00:22:11,070 --> 00:22:12,010
Tribulation Clouds.

514
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,660
A cultivator's about to be tested.

515
00:22:14,940 --> 00:22:15,980
[Cansheng, Turtle Island disciple]
Tribulation Clouds...

516
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,420
You brat.

517
00:22:22,790 --> 00:22:24,730
You've been hiding
so much Spiritual Energy?

518
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,330
I'm not quite ready,

519
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,860
but I have to go through with it.

520
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,620
There's no turning back now.

521
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:48,980
Hanzhi,

522
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:50,010
listen to me.

523
00:22:50,030 --> 00:22:51,380
Most cultivators are lucky

524
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:53,330
to get through two or three strikes.

525
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:55,770
Back in my day, I had four.

526
00:22:56,070 --> 00:22:57,460
It was extremely uncommon.

527
00:22:58,070 --> 00:22:59,940
So how many are in these clouds now?

528
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:06,460
One, two, three...

529
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,530
Could it be the Eightfold
Immortal-Summoning Tribulation,

530
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:15,460
one of the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations?

531
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:19,220
From the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations?

532
00:23:19,270 --> 00:23:19,810
Yes.

533
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:23,620
This kind of Tribulation is deadly.

534
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,010
Most who face it

535
00:23:25,030 --> 00:23:26,570
will be destroyed, body and soul.

536
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,570
The Eightfold
Immortal-Summoning Tribulation

537
00:23:28,590 --> 00:23:30,460
ranks fourth among
the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations.

538
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:32,090
Only cultivators with extreme talent

539
00:23:32,110 --> 00:23:33,420
will face this kind of Tribulation.

540
00:23:34,790 --> 00:23:35,730
What a shame.

541
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:38,140
A genius prodigy like me

542
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:40,050
is doomed to fall in the South Sea.

543
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:42,250
Mentor, could your calculations be off?

544
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:45,980
I, Yuan Ze,

545
00:23:46,030 --> 00:23:47,770
knowing all, past and present,

546
00:23:47,790 --> 00:23:49,460
dubbed the Three Realms Know-It-All.

547
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:50,180
Impossible.

548
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,860
I do not make mistakes.

549
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:54,460
Three Realms Know-It-All?

550
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,330
More like a Jinx-It-All.

551
00:23:57,550 --> 00:23:58,460
What did you say?

552
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:01,050
What if he survives it?

553
00:24:02,070 --> 00:24:04,810
The Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations
aren't that easy.

554
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,460
I'll bet you.

555
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,050
If he survives safely,

556
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,220
I, Yuan Ze,

557
00:24:11,070 --> 00:24:12,530
will never speak again.

558
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:15,250
Your spit is all over my face.

559
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:23,940
Tingly.

560
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:26,140
Feels pretty good, actually.

561
00:24:34,380 --> 00:24:37,070
[Mage Birdcage]

562
00:24:37,070 --> 00:24:38,700
Thanks, Lord Tribulation,

563
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:41,700
for taking time to strike me.

564
00:24:46,590 --> 00:24:47,250
Hanzhi.

565
00:24:47,550 --> 00:24:48,490
Did you see that?

566
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:49,940
The majestic lightning

567
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:52,940
is Fate testing cultivators.

568
00:24:53,110 --> 00:24:54,050
If you make it through

569
00:24:54,350 --> 00:24:55,980
